{"seq":3,"slug":"child-status-aggregate","title":"子单状态聚合到父单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/parent-child-consistency/child-status-aggregate","wordCount":2161,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"子单状态聚合到父单\">子单状态聚合到父单</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-父单状态是一个纯函数-不是一个-最后写入-的字段\">核心概念：父单状态是一个纯函数，不是一个&quot;最后写入&quot;的字段</h2><p>子单的状态会以<strong>乱序</strong>到达父单：仓 A 的出库事件可能比仓 B 的接单事件晚到，承运商的揽收扫描可能比仓内打包事件先落库，重试机制可能让同一个事件到达两次。如果父单状态是「谁最后更新谁说了算」，这些乱序就会让父单在一段时间内显示成错误的值，而且不可复现——同样的子单最终状态，可能因为到达顺序不同而产生不同的父单终态。</p>\n<p>正确的做法是把父单状态定义为一个<strong>纯函数</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>parentStatus</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mtext>fo</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>status</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{parentStatus} = f(\\{\\text{fo}_k.\\text{status}\\})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">parentStatus</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">({</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fo</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">status</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 只依赖子单状态的<strong>集合</strong>而不依赖它们的到达顺序或时间戳。这个函数的确定性保证了两个性质：<strong>幂等</strong>（同一事件重复到达，结果不变）与<strong>可重算</strong>（任何时刻都可以用当前子单状态全集重算出父单状态，无需事件日志）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[子单状态事件&lt;br/&gt;乱序/重复] --&gt; B[事件去重&lt;br/&gt;按 event_id]&#10;  B --&gt; C[更新子单状态&lt;br/&gt;带版本号 CAS]&#10;  C --&gt; D[读取该父单全部子单状态]&#10;  D --&gt; E[纯函数聚合 f 集合]&#10;  E --&gt; F[写回父单状态&lt;br/&gt;仅在值变化时]&#10;  F --&gt; G[发出父单状态变更事件&lt;br/&gt;供下游消费]\">graph TD\n  A[子单状态事件&lt;br/&gt;乱序/重复] --&gt; B[事件去重&lt;br/&gt;按 event_id]\n  B --&gt; C[更新子单状态&lt;br/&gt;带版本号 CAS]\n  C --&gt; D[读取该父单全部子单状态]\n  D --&gt; E[纯函数聚合 f 集合]\n  E --&gt; F[写回父单状态&lt;br/&gt;仅在值变化时]\n  F --&gt; G[发出父单状态变更事件&lt;br/&gt;供下游消费]</pre><p>图中 <code>C</code> 的「带版本号 CAS」是防止旧事件覆盖新状态的手段：事件携带其产生时的子单状态版本，版本落后则丢弃。没有这一步，一个延迟很久的旧事件会把已经推进的状态拉回去。</p>\n<h2 id=\"聚合函数的定义\">聚合函数的定义</h2><h3 id=\"状态格的偏序结构\">状态格的偏序结构</h3><p>子单状态不是无序的标签集合，它们构成一个<strong>偏序</strong>：<code>OPEN</code> 在 <code>PACKED</code> 之前，<code>PACKED</code> 在 <code>SHIPPED</code> 之前，<code>SHIPPED</code> 在 <code>DELIVERED</code> 之前。有了偏序，聚合函数才有意义。一个被广泛使用的履约状态链是 <code>OPEN → IN_PROGRESS → CLOSED</code>（履约作业视角）与 <code>SUBMITTED → ACCEPTED</code>（三方请求视角），两类状态必须分开，这在 <a href=\"parent-child-order-model\">父单/子单数据模型</a> 中已经界定。</p>\n<p>父单状态的聚合规则可以完整地写出来，关键是它们覆盖所有子单状态的组合而不是只看一个「最落后」的子单：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子单状态集合的情形</th>\n<th>父单状态</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全部 <code>CANCELLED</code></td>\n<td><code>CANCELLED</code></td>\n<td>无任何履约发生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全部 <code>DELIVERED</code></td>\n<td><code>COMPLETED</code></td>\n<td>完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分 <code>DELIVERED</code>、其余在途</td>\n<td><code>PARTIALLY_DELIVERED</code></td>\n<td>部分送达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分 <code>SHIPPED</code>、其余未发</td>\n<td><code>PARTIALLY_SHIPPED</code></td>\n<td>关键体验状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全部 <code>SHIPPED</code></td>\n<td><code>SHIPPED</code></td>\n<td>全部发出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存在任一 <code>ON_HOLD</code></td>\n<td><code>ON_HOLD</code></td>\n<td>阻塞优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>其余</td>\n<td><code>PROCESSING</code></td>\n<td>兜底</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 <code>PARTIALLY_SHIPPED</code> 与 <code>PARTIALLY_DELIVERED</code> 的区分不是锦上添花，而是买家体验的核心：前者意味着「还有包裹没发」，后者意味着「都发了但还没全到」。这两个状态下买家可以采取的合理行动不同——前者可能需要联系客服催发货，后者通常只能等待。把二者混为一个「部分完成」会削弱这个区分能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么不能用-最落后子单-作为父单状态\">为什么不能用&quot;最落后子单&quot;作为父单状态</h3><p>一个常见的简化是「父单状态 = 状态最落后的那个子单的状态」。它实现简单，但在一个关键场景下是错的：三个子单分别是 <code>DELIVERED</code>、<code>DELIVERED</code>、<code>CANCELLED</code>，最落后的是被取消的那个，于是父单显示 <code>CANCELLED</code>——但买家实际收到了两个包裹。正确的结果应该是 <code>PARTIALLY_DELIVERED</code>（或按业务口径标记为「部分完成，部分取消」）。</p>\n<p>修正方法是让聚合函数按<strong>维度</strong>分别计算而不是只挑一个子单：已送达数、已发出数、已取消数、总数。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>parentStatus</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>COMPLETED</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>delivered</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>PARTIALLY_DELIVERED</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>delivered</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> shipped</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>PARTIALLY_SHIPPED</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>shipped</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>CANCELLED</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>cancelled</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>SHIPPED</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>shipped</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{parentStatus} = \\begin{cases} \\text{COMPLETED} &amp; \\text{delivered} = n \\\\ \\text{PARTIALLY\\_DELIVERED} &amp; 0 &lt; \\text{delivered} &lt; n \\ \\wedge\\ \\text{shipped} = n \\\\ \\text{PARTIALLY\\_SHIPPED} &amp; 0 &lt; \\text{shipped} &lt; n \\\\ \\text{CANCELLED} &amp; \\text{cancelled} = n \\\\ \\text{SHIPPED} &amp; \\text{shipped} = n \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">parentStatus</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.2em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.366em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.816em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.358em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.816em;\"></span><span style=\"height:1.816em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"1.816em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 1816\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V1816 H384z M384 0 H504 V1816 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.816em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.816em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.958em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.816em;\"></span><span style=\"height:1.816em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"1.816em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 1816\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V1816 H384z M384 0 H504 V1816 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.766em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.816em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COMPLETED</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PARTIALLY_DELIVERED</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PARTIALLY_SHIPPED</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CANCELLED</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.09em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SHIPPED</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">delivered</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">delivered</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shipped</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shipped</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cancelled</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.09em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shipped</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个函数的输入是四个整数（每个子单按其状态归入一类），因此可以写成一行 SQL 聚合，代价是每个父单的一次索引扫描——这就是 <a href=\"parent-child-order-model\">父单/子单数据模型</a> 里 <code>idx_fo_parent_status</code> 的用途。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE parent_order p&#10;SET status = agg.new_status,&#10;    status_version = p.status_version + 1,&#10;    updated_at = now()&#10;FROM (&#10;  SELECT parent_order_id,&#10;         CASE&#10;           WHEN count(*) FILTER (WHERE status = &#39;CANCELLED&#39;) = count(*) THEN &#39;CANCELLED&#39;&#10;           WHEN count(*) FILTER (WHERE status = &#39;DELIVERED&#39;) = count(*) THEN &#39;COMPLETED&#39;&#10;           WHEN count(*) FILTER (WHERE status = &#39;DELIVERED&#39;) &gt; 0 THEN &#39;PARTIALLY_DELIVERED&#39;&#10;           WHEN count(*) FILTER (WHERE status IN (&#39;SHIPPED&#39;,&#39;DELIVERED&#39;)) = count(*) THEN &#39;SHIPPED&#39;&#10;           WHEN count(*) FILTER (WHERE status IN (&#39;SHIPPED&#39;,&#39;DELIVERED&#39;)) &gt; 0 THEN &#39;PARTIALLY_SHIPPED&#39;&#10;           WHEN count(*) FILTER (WHERE status = &#39;ON_HOLD&#39;) &gt; 0 THEN &#39;ON_HOLD&#39;&#10;           ELSE &#39;PROCESSING&#39;&#10;         END AS new_status&#10;  FROM fulfillment_order&#10;  WHERE parent_order_id = $1&#10;  GROUP BY parent_order_id&#10;) agg&#10;WHERE p.parent_order_id = agg.parent_order_id&#10;  AND p.status IS DISTINCT FROM agg.new_status;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parent_order p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> agg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">new_status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    status_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status_version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parent_order_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CANCELLED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CANCELLED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DELIVERED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'COMPLETED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DELIVERED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PARTIALLY_DELIVERED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SHIPPED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DELIVERED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SHIPPED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SHIPPED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DELIVERED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PARTIALLY_SHIPPED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ON_HOLD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ON_HOLD'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PROCESSING'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fulfillment_order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parent_order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parent_order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) agg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> agg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> agg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">new_status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>AND p.status IS DISTINCT FROM agg.new_status</code> 是必需的：只有值真正变化时才写库并递增版本。这让重复触发聚合变成无副作用的操作，也让状态变更事件不会因为重复计算而重复发出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件去重与顺序处理\">事件去重与顺序处理</h2><h3 id=\"去重键的设计\">去重键的设计</h3><p>每个子单状态事件必须携带一个<strong>稳定的事件标识</strong>，去重表以它为唯一键。跨服务场景下推荐的组合是 <code>(parent_order_id, fo_id, source, source_event_id)</code>——其中 <code>source_event_id</code> 来自上游系统的原始 ID，而不是本地生成的自增号。这样即使上游重发，本地也能识别。</p>\n<p>去重与业务写入必须在<strong>同一个事务</strong>里完成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"BEGIN;&#10;INSERT INTO processed_status_event (parent_order_id, fo_id, source, source_event_id)&#10;VALUES ($1, $2, $3, $4)&#10;ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;&#10;-- 影响行数为 0 说明该事件已处理过，跳过业务写入&#10;UPDATE fulfillment_order&#10;SET status = $5, status_version = status_version + 1&#10;WHERE fo_id = $2 AND status_version &lt; $6;&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processed_status_event (parent_order_id, fo_id, source, source_event_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ($</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT DO NOTHING;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 影响行数为 0 说明该事件已处理过，跳过业务写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fulfillment_order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, status_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> status_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fo_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> status_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这是<strong>幂等消费者</strong>模式的标准实现：把已处理消息的 ID 与业务变更放在同一事务中，以 <code>(subscriber, messageId)</code> 作主键，冲突即表示重复投递，回滚并忽略（<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/communication-style/idempotent-consumer.html\">Idempotent Consumer</a>）。这一模式的必要性来自消息系统普遍的<strong>至少一次投递</strong>语义——投递保证是「至少一次」而不是「恰好一次」，因此消费端必须自己承受重复。</p>\n<h3 id=\"事件发布与状态写入的原子性\">事件发布与状态写入的原子性</h3><p>状态写库之后要发出「父单状态变更」事件给下游（通知、客服、数据分析）。如果先写库再发消息，进程在两者之间崩溃就会丢事件；如果先发消息再写库，消息可能指向一个还不存在的状态。两种失败都会造成不一致。</p>\n<p>标准的解法是<strong>事务性发件箱</strong>（transactional outbox）：把待发消息写进与业务数据<strong>同一个事务</strong>中的 outbox 表，再由独立的 relay 进程读取并投递（<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/transactional-outbox.html\">Transactional Outbox</a>）。这样保证了「当且仅当数据库事务提交时消息才被发出」，代价是下游仍需容忍重复投递（所以消费端要幂等），以及 relay 进程本身需要监控。</p>\n<p>对本系统来说，outbox 的适用位置是<strong>父单状态变更事件</strong>，而不是每一个子单状态变更——子单状态本身通过聚合函数推导，下游可以订阅父单事件后自行拉取子单明细，避免事件量爆炸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间戳语义与承诺对齐\">时间戳语义与承诺对齐</h2><h3 id=\"三类时间不能混用\">三类时间不能混用</h3><p>父单与子单上会同时存在多个时间戳，它们的语义完全不同，混用会让承诺达成率的计算彻底失真：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>归属</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>promised_delivery_at</code></td>\n<td>对买家的承诺</td>\n<td>父单</td>\n<td>达成率分子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>shipped_at</code></td>\n<td>实际出库时间</td>\n<td>子单</td>\n<td>时效分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>delivered_at</code></td>\n<td>实际签收时间</td>\n<td>子单</td>\n<td>承诺达成判定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>承诺达成率的分母是订单数、分子是「所有子单的 <code>delivered_at</code> 都不晚于 (父单承诺时间 + 容差)」的订单数。这里有一个必须显式处理的细节：<strong>只有当全部子单都送达时，父单的承诺才算达成</strong>，部分送达的订单不算达成也不算未达成，应单独归入「部分完成」类，在报表里单列而不是硬塞进分子或分母。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与上下游-hub-的边界\">与上下游 hub 的边界</h3><p>本 hub 只负责把子单状态聚合成父单状态，<strong>不负责定义交易侧的订单状态语义</strong>。订单在交易视角下的生命周期（待支付、已支付、待发货、已完成、已关闭）由交易域的订单状态机定义，本 hub 的父单状态是它的一个输入而非替代。这个边界在实际实现中表现为：父单状态变更事件被交易域消费，映射到交易状态机的一个转移，映射规则由交易域拥有。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>父单状态必须定义为子单状态集合的<strong>纯函数</strong>，保证幂等与可重算；不能是「最后写入」的字段。</li>\n<li>子单状态构成<strong>偏序</strong>（OPEN → PACKED → SHIPPED → DELIVERED），聚合函数依赖这个结构。</li>\n<li>聚合必须<strong>按维度计数</strong>（delivered / shipped / cancelled / total），不能简化成「最落后子单」，否则会出现「收到两个包裹但显示已取消」这类错误。</li>\n<li>关键区分是 <code>PARTIALLY_SHIPPED</code> 与 <code>PARTIALLY_DELIVERED</code>，它们对应买家不同的可选行动。</li>\n<li>状态写入必须带<strong>版本号 CAS</strong>（<code>status_version</code>），落后的旧事件丢弃；写回只在值变化时进行（<code>IS DISTINCT FROM</code>）。</li>\n<li>事件处理必须<strong>幂等</strong>：去重键用上游原始事件 ID，去重表与业务写入在同一事务（幂等消费者模式），因为消息投递是至少一次语义。</li>\n<li>状态变更事件的发布用<strong>事务性发件箱</strong>保证与数据库事务原子；下游仍需容忍重复。</li>\n<li><code>promised_delivery_at</code>（父单）与 <code>delivered_at</code>（子单）不可混用；承诺达成率中「部分送达」订单应单列，不塞进分子或分母。</li>\n<li>父单状态是交易域状态的<strong>输入</strong>而非替代，交易状态语义由交易域的订单状态机拥有。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"子单状态聚合到父单","id":"子单状态聚合到父单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：父单状态是一个纯函数，不是一个\"最后写入\"的字段","id":"核心概念-父单状态是一个纯函数-不是一个-最后写入-的字段"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合函数的定义","id":"聚合函数的定义"},{"level":3,"text":"状态格的偏序结构","id":"状态格的偏序结构"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不能用\"最落后子单\"作为父单状态","id":"为什么不能用-最落后子单-作为父单状态"},{"level":2,"text":"事件去重与顺序处理","id":"事件去重与顺序处理"},{"level":3,"text":"去重键的设计","id":"去重键的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"事件发布与状态写入的原子性","id":"事件发布与状态写入的原子性"},{"level":2,"text":"时间戳语义与承诺对齐","id":"时间戳语义与承诺对齐"},{"level":3,"text":"三类时间不能混用","id":"三类时间不能混用"},{"level":3,"text":"与上下游 hub 的边界","id":"与上下游-hub-的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分仓并发预留与合单窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/parent-child-consistency/parallel-reserve-merge-window"},"next":{"title":"部分发货与合并展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/split-fulfillment-ops/partial-ship-customer-combine"}}